<BaseLayout title="About" description="Meet Lot Holmstead, a BYU Information Systems student pursuing product management and tech startup opportunities.">
  <section class="about-simple">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-simple-copy">
        <h1>About me.</h1>
        <p>I’m Lot, an Information Systems student at BYU based in Orem, Utah. I’m interested in product management and tech startups—understanding a problem, building something useful, and improving it through feedback.</p>
        <p>I’ve worked on projects ranging from games to custom websites. My experience in business development, customer support, and teaching helps me connect technical work with what people need.</p>
        <p>Outside work, I enjoy snowboarding, dirt biking, and time outdoors with my wife, friends, and family. I also served a two-year mission in the Philippines, learned Tagalog, and am a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.</p>
        <div class="about-simple-links"><a class="button button-primary" href="/#projects">View projects</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-collage" aria-label="Photos of my hobbies, family, and time in the Philippines">
        <figure class="about-collage-item collage-dirt-bike"><img src="/images/lot-dirt-biking.webp" alt="Lot on a dirt bike on a mountain trail." width="1800" height="2400" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></figure>
        <figure class="about-collage-item collage-snowboard"><img src="/images/lot-snowboarding.webp" alt="Lot with his snowboard at a snowy mountain resort." width="828" height="826" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></figure>
        <figure class="about-collage-item collage-jeep"><img src="/images/lot-jeep-outdoors.webp" alt="Lot and a companion beside a Jeep on a rocky mountain trail." width="1200" height="1793" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></figure>
        <figure class="about-collage-item collage-family"><img src="/images/lot-wedding.webp" alt="Lot and his wife on their wedding day." width="1200" height="1800" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></figure>
        <figure class="about-collage-item collage-mission"><img src="/images/lot-mission-philippines.webp" alt="Lot during his missionary service in the Philippines." width="1600" height="1200" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
